	"Game-Faction-Allies-Desc": "Allies",
	"Game-Faction-Allies-Name": "Allies",
	"Game-Faction-Arc-Desc": "Advanced Robotics Command: Robotics\nUnits:\n• Mini Drone\n• Jackknife\n• Guardian Drone (replaces Hum-Vee)\nPowers:\n• Nanite Repair\nUpgrades:\n• Mammoth Drone (replaces Mammoth Tank)\n• Battle Drone (replaces Battle Tank)\nBonuses:\n• Recon Drone (-20% cooldown)\n• Mobile Sensor Array (20% discount)\n• Drone Carrier (10% discount)\n• Additional Comms. Centers (50% discount)\n• Comms. Center emergency backup power\n• Newly produced drones reclaim XP of those destroyed",
	"Game-Faction-Arc-Name": "ARC",
	"Game-Faction-Blackh-Desc": "Black Hand: Flame Weaponry\nUnits:\n• Black Hand Trooper\n• Heavy Flame Tank (replaces Flame Tank)\nPowers:\n• Inferno Bomb\n• Heavy Flame Tank Drop\nUpgrades:\n• Black Napalm\nBonuses:\n• SSM (extra missile)\n• Flamethrower/Chem Warrior (+20% speed)\n• Free Howitzer Upgrade",
	"Game-Faction-Blackh-Name": "Black Hand",
	"Game-Faction-Collector-Desc": "Collector-73: Leeching & Degeneration\nUnits:\n• Atomizer\n• Leecher (replaces Corrupter)\nPowers:\n• Greater Coalescence\nUpgrades:\n• Coalescence\nBonuses:\n• Watcher (attack applies suppression)\n• Field Manipulator (20% discount)\n• Suppression Field (-15% cooldown, +10% duration)",
	"Game-Faction-Collector-Name": "Collector-73",
	"Game-Faction-Eagle-Desc": "Eagle Corps: Rapid Reaction Force\nUnits:\n• Pitbull\n• Aurora\n• Hover MLRS (replaces MLRS)\nPowers:\n• Reinforcements\nUpgrades:\n• Hover Mammoth (replaces Mammoth Tank)\n• Afterburners\nBonuses:\n• Aircraft (10% discount)\n• Airfields repair aircraft without requiring Service Depot nearby",
	"Game-Faction-Eagle-Name": "Eagle",
	"Game-Faction-England-Desc": "England: Subterfuge\nUnits:\n• Sniper\n• Mirage Tank (replaces Scout Tank)\n• Camo Pillbox (replaces Pillbox)\nPowers:\n• Veil of War\nUpgrades:\n• Raufoss Ammo\nBonuses:\n• Fake Buildings\n• Spy (+2 Vision)",
	"Game-Faction-England-Name": "England",
	"Game-Faction-France-Desc": "France: Fortification\nUnits:\n• Battle Fortress\n• Grand Cannon (replaces Prism Tower)\nPowers:\n• Cluster Mines\nUpgrades:\n• Entrenchment\nBonuses:\n• Prism Tank/Cannon (deploy to fortify)\n• Defenses (10% discount)\n• Walls (30% discount)",
	"Game-Faction-France-Name": "France",
	"Game-Faction-Gdi-Desc": "GDI",
	"Game-Faction-Gdi-Name": "GDI",
	"Game-Faction-Germany-Desc": "Germany: Innovation\nUnits:\n• Chrono Prison\n• Tank Destroyer\nPowers:\n• Temporal Incursion\n• Time Warp\nUpgrades:\n• Temporal Flux\nBonuses:\n• Chrono Tank (+1 teleport charge)\n• Chronosphere (20% discount)",
	"Game-Faction-Germany-Name": "Germany",
	"Game-Faction-Harbinger-Desc": "Harbinger-31: Heavy Weapons\nUnits:\n• Obliterator\n• Marauder (replaces Intruder)\nPowers:\n• Buzzer Swarm\nUpgrades:\n• Stellar Fusion Cannon\nBonuses:\n• Interloper (deals splash damage)\n• Devastator Warship (+3 range)",
	"Game-Faction-Harbinger-Name": "Harbinger-31",
	"Game-Faction-Iraq-Desc": "Iraq: Nuclear Warfare\nUnits:\n• Rad Trooper (replaces Shock Trooper)\n• Chem Tower (replaces Flame Tower)\nPowers:\n• A-Bomb\n• Paratroopers\nUpgrades:\n• Desolator (replaces Rad Trooper)\n• Eradicator (replaces Mammoth Tank)\nBonuses:\n• Heavy Hazmat Suits equipped as standard\n• V2 (fires radioactive warheads)\n• Kirov Atom Bombs",
	"Game-Faction-Iraq-Name": "Iraq",
	"Game-Faction-Legion-Desc": "Legion: Stolen Technology\nUnits:\n  • Microwave Tank\n  • APC\n  • Battle Tank (replaces Light Tank)\n\nPowers:\n  • Cash Hack\n  • Technology Hack\n\nUpgrades:\n  • Intensified Microwaves\n\nBonuses:\n  • Stolen Technology Units (10% discount)\n  • Hack Satellite (-33% cooldown)",
	"Game-Faction-Legion-Name": "Legion",
	"Game-Faction-Marked-Desc": "Marked of Kane: Alien Weaponry\nUnits:\n• Acolyte/Templar\n• Venom (replaces Apache)\nPowers:\n• Frenzy\n• Subterranean Strike\nUpgrades:\n• Quantum Capacitors\nBonuses:\n• Avatar, Cyborg Elite, Enlightened & Cyborg Reaper (+1 veterancy)\n• Temple Prime (10% discount)",
	"Game-Faction-Marked-Name": "Marked",
	"Game-Faction-Nod-Desc": "Nod",
	"Game-Faction-Nod-Name": "Nod",
