	"Game-Faction-Randomsoviet-Desc": "Random Soviet Faction\nA random Soviet faction will be chosen when the game starts.",
	"Game-Faction-Randomsoviet-Name": "Soviet",
	"Game-Faction-Reaper-Desc": "Reaper-17: Frontal Assault\nUnits:\n• Stormcrawler\n• Reaper Tripod (replaces Annihilator Tripod)\nPowers:\n• Storm Spike\nUpgrades:\n• Ion Conduits\nBonuses:\n• Resource Conversion also applies to Corrupters\n• Ichor Seed (-20% cooldown)",
	"Game-Faction-Reaper-Name": "Reaper-17",
	"Game-Faction-Russia-Desc": "Russia: Tesla Techology\nUnits:\n• Tesla Tank\n• Tesla Reactor (replaces Advanced Power Plant)\nPowers:\n• Storm Troopers\n• Parabombs\nUpgrades:\n• Tesla Arcing\nBonuses:\n• Tesla Reactors boost nearby Tesla Coils\n• Free Tesla Trooper Upgrade\n• Kirov Tesla Bombs",
	"Game-Faction-Russia-Name": "Russia",
	"Game-Faction-Scrin-Desc": "Scrin",
	"Game-Faction-Scrin-Name": "Scrin",
	"Game-Faction-Shadow-Desc": "Shadow Sect: Stealth Technology\nUnits:\n• Mobile Stealth Generator\n• Spectre (replaces SSM)\nPowers:\n• Shadow Team\n• Stealth Tank Drop\nUpgrades:\n• Heavy Stealth Tank\nBonuses:\n• Stealth units move 10% faster while cloaked\n• Stealth Generator (+4 passive range)",
	"Game-Faction-Shadow-Name": "Shadow",
	"Game-Faction-Soviet-Desc": "Soviet",
	"Game-Faction-Soviet-Name": "Soviet",
	"Game-Faction-Talon-Desc": "Steel Talon: Mech Warfare\nUnits:\n  • Wolverine\n  • Juggernaut\n  • Titan (replaces Mammoth Tank)\n\nPowers:\n  • X-O Drop\n\nUpgrades:\n  • Railgun Titan (replaces Titan)\n  • Gyro Stabilizers\n\nBonuses:\n  • Tech Center (10% discount)\n  • Upgrade Center (20% discount)",
	"Game-Faction-Talon-Name": "Talon",
	"Game-Faction-Traveler-Desc": "Traveler-59: Fast Attack\nUnits:\n• Enervator\n• Lacerator (replaces Seeker)\nPowers:\n• Ion Surge\nUpgrades:\n• Advanced Articulators\nBonuses:\n• Fast Walkers (+15% speed)\n• Colony Ship (+15% speed)",
	"Game-Faction-Traveler-Name": "Traveler-59",
	"Game-Faction-Ukraine-Desc": "Ukraine: Demolition\nUnits:\n• V3 Launcher\n• Siege Tank (replaces V2)\n• Crazy Ivan (replaces Grenadier)\nPowers:\n• Carpet Bomb\n• Paratroopers\nUpgrades:\n• Seismic Missiles\nBonuses:\n• Hind rockets reduce enemy movement speed & rate of fire\n• Terror Dog (20% discount)\n• Kirov Cluster Bombs",
	"Game-Faction-Ukraine-Name": "Ukraine",
	"Game-Faction-Usa-Desc": "USA: Airborne Forces\nUnits:\n  • SEAL\n  • Nighthawk (replaces Chinook)\n  • Guardian GI (via Airdrop)\n  • Grizzly Tank (via Airdrop)\n\nPowers:\n  • Strafing Run\n\nUpgrades:\n  • Advanced Airborne Training\n\nBonuses:\n  • Airdrop Units",
	"Game-Faction-Usa-Name": "USA",
	"Game-Faction-Yuri-Desc": "Psychic Corps: Mind Control & Genetics\nUnits:\n• Brute\n• Floating Disc (replaces Kirov)\n• Chaos Drone (replaces MAD Tank)\n• Yuri (replaces Boris)\nPowers:\n• Genetic Mutation Bomb\n• Chaos Bombs\nUpgrades:\n• Lasher Tank\n• Gattling BTR\nBonuses:\n• Spy Plane (psychic detection after vision fades)",
	"Game-Faction-Yuri-Name": "Psi-Corps",
	"Game-Faction-Zocom-Desc": "ZOCOM: Experimental Weapons\nUnits:\n  • X-O Powersuit\n  • Disruptor\n  • Sonic Tower (replaces Advanced Guard Tower)\n\nPowers:\n  • Drop Pods\n  • Surgical Strike\n\nUpgrades:\n  • Ion Mammoth (replaces Mammoth Tank)\n  • Sonic Amplifiers\n\nBonuses:\n  • Adv. Communication Center (40% discount)\n  • Hazmat Suits equipped as standard",
	"Game-Faction-Zocom-Name": "ZOCOM",
